; wininet_extra.def - import definitions for wininet.dll exports that are
; present in the MSVC Windows SDK import library (wininet.lib) but missing
; from LLVM-MinGW's libwininet.a (undocumented/legacy exports).
;
; The yact wininet replacement DLL references these symbols because the
; original sources declare them next to the yact_* implementations; the MSVC
; build resolves them from wininet.lib.  Generate an import library with:
;   llvm-dlltool -m arm -D wininet.dll -d wininet_extra.def -l wininet_extra.a
LIBRARY wininet.dll
EXPORTS
DoConnectoidsExist
ExportCookieFileA
ExportCookieFileW
FindP3PPolicySymbol
FreeP3PObject
GetDiskInfoA
GetP3PPolicy
GetP3PRequestStatus
HttpCheckDavComplianceA
HttpCheckDavComplianceW
ImportCookieFileA
ImportCookieFileW
IsDomainLegalCookieDomainA
IsDomainLegalCookieDomainW
IsProfilesEnabled
MapResourceToPolicy
PerformOperationOverUrlCacheA
